title: Die Rote Fahne
new-page: true
view-if: crisis = 0 and rote_fahne_timer <= 0
on-arrival: rote_fahne_timer = 3; month_actions += 1
frequency: 300
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs

= Die Rote Fahne

The party paper reaches tens of thousands of readers[? if repression >= 60 : , when the police let it appear at all. Half its editors have been arrested at one time or another ?]. The Zentrale must decide what it will say this month.

[? if year >= 1921 : Beside Die Rote Fahne, the party now has dailies in most big cities, and every one of them has opinions. ?]

- @line: Argue for the Zentrale's line.
- @debate: Open the paper to debate.
- @attack: Attack the SPD leaders who sent the Freikorps.
- @regional: Fund new local editions.
- @easy_discard

@line
subtitle: Districts move towards the Zentrale; other currents resent it.
on-arrival: {!
for (var d of Q.districts) {
    Q['district_' + d + '_loyalty'] += 5;
}
for (var f of Q.factions) {
    if (f != Q.leading_faction) {
        Q[f + '_satisfaction'] -= 3;
    }
}
Q['lean_' + Q.leading_faction] += 1;
!}

The paper explains the Zentrale's line, patiently and at length. Some districts are persuaded.

@debate
subtitle: Every current feels heard.
on-arrival: {!
for (var f of Q.factions) {
    Q[f + '_satisfaction'] += 4;
}
Q.lean_luxemburgist += 1;
!}

Letters and articles from every wing of the party fill the pages. Rosa Luxemburg would approve: freedom is always the freedom of those who think differently.

@attack
subtitle: Pleases the radicals; burns bridges with the SPD.
on-arrival: {!
Q.spd_relation -= 10;
Q.militancy += 5;
Q.worker_support += 2;
Q.offensive_satisfaction += 5;
Q.lean_offensive += 1;
if (!Q.ultraleft_gone) {
    Q.ultraleft_satisfaction += 5;
}
!}

Noske the bloodhound, Ebert the traitor. The words sell papers.

@regional
subtitle: Costs 1 fund. More workers read us; the districts feel closer to the party.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: We have no funds.
on-arrival: {!
Q.resources -= 1;
Q.worker_support += 3;
for (var d of Q.districts) {
    Q['district_' + d + '_loyalty'] += 2;
}
!}

New local editions appear in the Ruhr and in Saxony, with the factory news on the front page and Berlin's articles inside.
